/F1 24 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 516 Tm
(Introduction to Plate Tectonics) Tj
/F1 14 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 476 Tm
(Х Plate tectonics explains how the outer shell of the Earth moves over time.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 446 Tm
(Х The shell, called the lithosphere, is broken into large and small plates.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 416 Tm
(Х The plates move only a few centimetres each year.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 386 Tm
(Х Over millions of years this slow motion reshapes continents and oceans.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 356 Tm
(Х The theory ties together earthquakes, volcanoes and mountain building.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 326 Tm
(Х The idea grew from older observations of how the continents seem to fit) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 306 Tm
(  together.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
