<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 792 612] /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R >> >> /Contents 21 0 R >>
endobj
21 0 obj
<< /Length 614 >>
stream
BT
/F1 24 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 516 Tm
(Earthquakes and Volcanoes) Tj
/F1 14 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 476 Tm
(Х Most earthquakes and volcanoes occur near plate boundaries.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 446 Tm
(Х The Pacific Ring of Fire follows a long chain of subduction zones.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 416 Tm
(Х Hot spots such as Hawaii form volcanoes far from any boundary.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 386 Tm
(Х Seismometers record earthquake waves and help locate their source.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 356 Tm
(Х Mapping these events reveals the outlines of the plates.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 326 Tm
(Х Early warning systems use this knowledge to reduce the damage from hazards.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
