/F1 24 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 516 Tm
(Summary) Tj
/F1 14 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 476 Tm
(Х The lithosphere is divided into plates that move slowly over the mantle.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 446 Tm
(Х Plates meet at divergent, convergent and transform boundaries.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 416 Tm
(Х Each boundary type produces typical landforms and hazards.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 386 Tm
(Х Mantle convection, ridge push and slab pull drive the motion.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 356 Tm
(Х Plate tectonics links many features of the Earth into one theory.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 326 Tm
(Х It is one of the central ideas of modern geology.) Tj
ET
endstream
